{"unit_id":"yangdongzhen590__dsh-knj-menu#card-zh","repo":"yangdongzhen590/dsh-knj-menu","commit":"37d57d523e5e43dc0f5c831dba79cf00ff05fdd6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-knj-menu 是面向 DSH 网页端的第三方插件菜单管理器。它通过 sidebar.footer.action 插槽显示统一菜单，并向其他插件提供 knj.menu.item 子插槽。菜单项按顺序排列，可固定在常驻区域，也可收进“更多”折叠菜单；用户可以展开或收起折叠项，固定状态保存在浏览器本地。适合安装了多个扩展、希望整理侧边栏入口的 DSH Web 用户。无需 API Key 或外部服务，需使用支持 slots 的 DSH Web 环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:123-145","lib/client.js:65-83","lib/client.js:103-119"]}
{"unit_id":"yangdongzhen590__dsh-knj-menu#card-en","repo":"yangdongzhen590/dsh-knj-menu","commit":"37d57d523e5e43dc0f5c831dba79cf00ff05fdd6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-knj-menu organizes third-party plugin entries in the DSH Web sidebar. It provides the knj.menu.item slot for extensions, sorts entries, and lets users pin favorites or fold other items into a More panel. Pin choices stay in browser localStorage. It needs no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:123-145","lib/client.js:65-83","lib/client.js:103-119"]}
